{"id":"nakonets","lemma":"наконец","pos":"adv","rank":449,"glosses":["at last, finally","in conclusion","Used as an emphasiser when demanding something to occur sooner / expressing impatience; (US) already"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/10/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%86.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%86.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Наконец он пришел.","en":"At last, he came.","words":[null,{"g":"he / it"},null]},{"text":"Я наконец здесь.","en":"I'm finally here.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Это наконец случилось.","en":"It finally happened.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"to happen","l":"случиться"}]},{"text":"Помощь наконец пришла.","en":"Help finally arrived.","words":[{"g":"help, assistance, aid"},null,{"g":"to come , to arrive","l":"прийти"}]},{"text":"Наконец я нашел его дом.","en":"At length, I found his house.","words":[null,{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"house, building"}]}]}